<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-12T20:59:02.015Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:59:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;US Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth was reprimanded by a guard at the Tomb of the Unknown Soldier and later awarded a medal to that guard, while advisers were also reprimanded at the site. In Yemen, Houthi forces held a mass funeral and continue to launch missile and drone attacks on Saudi targets, which Saudi Arabia says it intercepts, with debris falling near Mecca, though the Houthis deny targeting the holy city. Saudi Arabia is pressuring the EU to label the Houthis as a terrorist group. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/us-defense-secretary-pete-hegseth-reprimanded-at-war-memorial&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/world/middleeast/syria-weighs-sending-troops-to-aid-saudi-war-with-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2026/nov/12/mississippi-scott-colom-ukraine-donald-trump&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmvg2r3dq7xno?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxON1pYX0FiYnJXVm4tV0FZcGhMb0V0Z1hGQW9HUF9yNjVfdUFBQ284Uzl6MDNjbXo4MFktbmJYaE51NFV0NzE0REk2dTlNRmR1TzFGbzBZLWtldWRfSkpjZDVGRHg1SUo4ZEk1VlM1dUYyUzZHZHBXZ2NYdnFZU1RuTW40M203Y0ZBdjgwYnVGdnN0QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/12/video-shows-soldier-reprimanding-hegseth-and-advisers-at-tomb-of-the-unknown-soldier&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cU